msgid "BBCode in RichTextLabel"
msgstr "RichTextLabel 中的 BBCode"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "介绍"

msgid ""
":ref:`class_Label` nodes are great for displaying basic text, but they have "
"limitations. If you want to change the color of the text, or its alignment, "
"you can only do that to the entire label. You can't make a part of the text "
"have another color, or have a part of the text centered. To get around these "
"limitations, you would use a :ref:`class_RichTextLabel`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`class_Label` 节点非常适合显示基础文本，但有一定局限性。如果你需要改变文"
"本的颜色或其对齐方式，则只能对整个标签执行此操作。你不能使文本的一部分具有其"
"他颜色，也不能使文本的一部分居中。要绕过这些限制，你可以使"
"用 :ref:`class_RichTextLabel` 。"

msgid ""
"Unlike Label, RichTextLabel also comes with its own vertical scrollbar. This "
"scrollbar is automatically displayed if the text does not fit within the "
"control's size. The scrollbar can be disabled by unchecking the **Scroll "
"Active** property in the RichTextLabel inspector."
msgstr ""
"与 Label 不同，RichTextLabel 还带有自己的垂直滚动条。如果文本不适合控件的大"
"小，则会自动显示此滚动条。可以通过在 RichTextLabel 的检查器中取消选中 "
"**Scroll Active** 属性来禁用滚动条。"

msgid ""
"Note that the BBCode tags can also be used to some extent for other use "
"cases:"
msgstr "需要注意的是，BBCode 标签在一定程度上也可以用于其他场景："

msgid ""
"BBCode can be used to :ref:`format comments in the XML source of the class "
"reference <doc_class_reference_bbcode>`."
msgstr ""
"BBCode 还可以用于 :ref:`format comments in the XML source of the class "
"reference <doc_class_reference_bbcode>` 。"

msgid ""
"BBCode can be used in :ref:`GDScript documentation comments "
"<doc_gdscript_documentation_comments_bbcode_and_class_reference>`."
msgstr ""
"BBCode 也可以用在 :ref:`GDScript documentation comments "
"<doc_gdscript_documentation_comments_bbcode_and_class_reference>` 中。"

msgid ""
"BBCode can be used when :ref:`printing rich text to the Output bottom panel "
"<doc_output_panel_printing_rich_text>`."
msgstr ""
"当你在底部的 :ref:`printing rich text to the Output bottom panel "
"<doc_output_panel_printing_rich_text>` ，也可以使用 BBCode。"

msgid ""
"You can see how BBCode in RichTextLabel works in action using the `Rich Text "
"Label with BBCode demo project <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/gui/rich_text_bbcode>`__."
msgstr ""
"你可以通过 `Rich Text Label with BBCode demo project <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/gui/rich_text_bbcode>`__ 来直观地"
"看看 RichTextLabel 中的 BBCode 实际是如何运作的。"

msgid "Using BBCode"
msgstr "使用 BBCode"

msgid ""
"By default, :ref:`class_RichTextLabel` functions like a "
"normal :ref:`class_Label`. It has the :ref:`text "
"<class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` property, which you can edit to have "
"uniformly formatted text. To be able to use BBCode for rich text formatting, "
"you need to turn on the BBCode mode by setting :ref:`bbcode_enabled "
"<class_RichTextLabel_property_bbcode_enabled>`. After that, you can edit "
"the :ref:`text <class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` property using available "
"tags. Both properties are located at the top of the inspector after "
"selecting a RichTextLabel node."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，:ref:`class_RichTextLabel` 的功能和一个普通的 :ref:`class_Label` "
"一样。它拥有一个 :ref:`text <class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` 属性，你可以"
"编辑它来显示统一格式的文本。如果想要使用 BBCode 来实现富文本排版，你需要通过"
"设置 :ref:`bbcode_enabled <class_RichTextLabel_property_bbcode_enabled>` 来开"
"启 BBCode 模式。开启之后，你就可以在 :ref:`text "
"<class_RichTextLabel_property_text>` 属性中使用各种可用的标签了。选中 "
"RichTextLabel 节点后，这两个属性都位于检查器（Inspector）的最上方。"

msgid ""
"For example, ``BBCode [color=green]test[/color]`` would render the word "
"\"test\" with a green color."
msgstr ""
"例如， ``BBCode [color=green]test[/color]`` 会将单词 \"test\" 渲染成绿色。"

msgid ""
"Most BBCodes consist of 3 parts: the opening tag, the content and the "
"closing tag. The opening tag delimits the start of the formatted part, and "
"can also carry some configuration options. Some opening tags, like the "
"``color`` one shown above, also require a value to work. Other opening tags "
"may accept multiple options (separated by spaces within the opening tag). "
"The closing tag delimits the end of the formatted part. In some cases, both "
"the closing tag and the content can be omitted."
msgstr ""
"大多数 BBCode 都由三部分组成：开始标签、内容和结束标签。开始标签用来划定格式"
"化内容的起始位置，并且可以附带一些配置选项。像上面展示的那个 ``color`` （颜"
"色）标签，它的开始标签就需要搭配一个具体的值才能生效。还有一些开始标签可以接"
"受多个选项（在开始标签内部用空格隔开即可）。结束标签则用来划定格式化内容的结"
"束位置。在某些特定情况下，结束标签和内容部分是可以省略的。"

msgid ""
"Unlike BBCode in HTML, leading/trailing whitespace is not removed by a "
"RichTextLabel upon display. Duplicate spaces are also displayed as-is in the "
"final output. This means that when displaying a code block in a "
"RichTextLabel, you don't need to use a preformatted text tag."
msgstr ""
"与 HTML 中的 BBCode 不同，RichTextLabel 在显示文本时，并不会自动去除开头或结"
"尾的空白字符。最终输出的内容中，连续重复的空格也会被原样显示出来。这意味着，"
"当你在 RichTextLabel 中展示代码块时，完全不需要额外使用‘预格式化文本’"
"（preformatted text）标签来保留格式。"

msgid ""
"RichTextLabel doesn't support entangled BBCode tags. For example, instead of "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"RichTextLabel 不支持相互嵌套（或交错）的 BBCode 标签。例如，不要这样写："

msgid "Use:"
msgstr "请使用："

msgid "Handling user input safely"
msgstr "安全地处理用户输入"

msgid ""
"In a scenario where users may freely input text (such as chat in a "
"multiplayer game), you should make sure users cannot use arbitrary BBCode "
"tags that will be parsed by RichTextLabel. This is to avoid inappropriate "
"use of formatting, which can be problematic if ``[url]`` tags are handled by "
"your RichTextLabel (as players may be able to create clickable links to "
"phishing sites or similar)."
msgstr ""
"在用户可以自由输入文本的场景下（比如多人游戏的聊天系统），你应该确保用户无法"
"随意输入能被 RichTextLabel 解析的 BBCode 标签。这是为了避免格式被不当利用，特"
"别是当你的 RichTextLabel 支持处理 ``[url]`` 标签时，这可能会带来安全隐患（比"
"如玩家可能会创建出指向钓鱼网站或类似恶意页面的可点击链接）。"

msgid ""
"Example of unescaped user input resulting in BBCode injection (2nd line) and "
"escaped user input (3rd line)"
msgstr ""
"未转义的用户输入导致 BBCode 注入的示例（第 2 行），以及经过转义处理的用户输入"
"示例（第 3 行）"

msgid "The above image was created using the following script:"
msgstr "创建一个 Node 节点并附加下面的脚本："

msgid "Stripping BBCode tags"
msgstr "剥离 BBCode 标签"

msgid ""
"For certain use cases, it can be desired to remove BBCode tags from the "
"string. This is useful when displaying the RichTextLabel's text in another "
"Control that does not support BBCode (such as a tooltip):"
msgstr ""
"在某些特定的使用场景下，你可能需要从字符串中把 BBCode 标签给去掉。比如，当你"
"想把 RichTextLabel 里的文本显示在另一个不支持 BBCode 的控件中时（比如显示一个"
"鼠标悬停提示框/tooltip），这个操作就非常有用了。"

msgid ""
"Removing BBCode tags entirely isn't advised for user input, as it can modify "
"the displayed text without users understanding why part of their message was "
"removed. :ref:`Escaping user input "
"<doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_user_input_safely>` should be "
"preferred instead."
msgstr ""
"对于用户的输入内容，完全不建议直接删掉所有的 BBCode 标签。因为这样做可能会改"
"变用户原本想显示的文字，而且用户根本不知道为什么自己消息的一部分凭空消失了。"
"相反，更推荐的做法是对用户输入进行转义处理（具体操作可以参"
"考： :ref:`Escaping user input "
"<doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_user_input_safely>` ）。"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

msgid ""
"In most cases, you can use BBCode directly as-is since text formatting is "
"rarely a heavy task. However, with particularly large RichTextLabels (such "
"as console logs spanning thousands of lines), you may encounter stuttering "
"during gameplay when the RichTextLabel's text is updated."
msgstr ""
"在大多数情况下，你可以直接使用 BBCode，因为文本格式化通常算不上什么繁重的任"
"务。不过，如果遇到特别庞大的 RichTextLabel（比如长达数千行的控制台日志），当"
"更新其文本内容时，你可能会在游戏中遇到卡顿现象。"

msgid "There are several ways to alleviate this:"
msgstr "有几种方法可以缓解这个问题："

msgid ""
"Use the ``append_text()`` function instead of appending to the ``text`` "
"property. This function will only parse BBCode for the added text, rather "
"than parsing BBCode from the entire ``text`` property."
msgstr ""
"请使用 ``append_text()`` 函数，而不是直接往 ``text`` 属性里追加内容。因为这个"
"函数只会解析你新添加的那部分文本的 BBCode，而不是把整个 ``text`` 属性里的所"
"有 BBCode 重新解析一遍。"

msgid ""
"Use ``push_[tag]()`` and ``pop()`` functions to add tags to RichTextLabel "
"instead of using BBCode."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``push_[tag]()`` 和 ``pop()`` 函数来给 RichTextLabel 添加标签，而不是直"
"接使用 BBCode。"

msgid ""
"Enable the **Threading > Threaded** property in RichTextLabel. This won't "
"speed up processing, but it will prevent the main thread from blocking, "
"which avoids stuttering during gameplay. Only enable threading if it's "
"actually needed in your project, as threading has some overhead."
msgstr ""
"在 RichTextLabel 中启用 **Threading > Threaded** （线程化） 属性。这并不会加"
"快处理速度，但能防止主线程被阻塞，从而避免游戏运行过程中出现卡顿（掉帧）的现"
"象。只有当你的项目确实需要时才开启线程化，因为使用多线程会带来一定的性能开"
"销。"

msgid "Using push_[tag]() and pop() functions instead of BBCode"
msgstr "使用 push_[标签]() 和 pop() 函数代替 BBCode"

msgid ""
"If you don't want to use BBCode for performance reasons, you can use "
"functions provided by RichTextLabel to create formatting tags without "
"writing BBCode in the text."
msgstr ""
"如果你出于性能的考虑不想使用 BBCode，可以直接调用 RichTextLabel 提供的函数。"
"这样就能在不直接在文本里写 BBCode 代码的情况下，实现同样的格式化效果。"

msgid ""
"Every BBCode tag (including effects) has a ``push_[tag]()`` function (where "
"``[tag]`` is the tag's name). There are also a few convenience functions "
"available, such as ``push_bold_italics()`` that combines both "
"``push_bold()`` and ``push_italics()`` into a single tag. See "
"the :ref:`RichTextLabel class reference <class_RichTextLabel>` for a "
"complete list of ``push_[tag]()`` functions."
msgstr ""
"每一个 BBCode 标签（包括各种特效）都对应一个 ``push_[tag]()`` 函数（其中 "
"``[tag]`` 就是该标签的名称）。此外还提供了一些便捷的函数，比如 "
"``push_bold_italics()`` ，它可以把 ``push_bold()`` 和 ``push_italics()`` 合并"
"成一个标签来使用。如果想查看完整的 ``push_[tag]()`` 函数列表，请参"
"考： :ref:`RichTextLabel class reference <class_RichTextLabel>` 。"

msgid ""
"The ``pop()`` function is used to end *any* tag. Since BBCode is a tag "
"*stack*, using ``pop()`` will close the most recently started tags first."
msgstr ""
"``pop()`` 函数用于结束 *任何* 标签。由于 BBCode 采用的是标签 *堆栈* 结构，因"
"此使用 ``pop()`` 时，会优先关闭最近才开始（也就是最里层）的标签。"

msgid ""
"The following script will result in the same visual output as using ``BBCode "
"[color=green]test [i]example[/i][/color]``:"
msgstr ""
"运行下面的脚本，将会得到与使用 ``BBCode [color=green]test [i]example[/i][/"
"color]`` 完全相同的视觉效果："

msgid ""
"Do **not** set the ``text`` property directly when using formatting "
"functions. Appending to the ``text`` property will erase all modifications "
"made to the RichTextLabel using the ``append_text()``, ``push_[tag]()`` and "
"``pop()`` functions."
msgstr ""
"“在使用格式化函数时，千万 **不要** 直接设置 ``text`` 属性。向 ``text`` 属性追"
"加内容，将会抹除所有通过 ``append_text()`` 、 ``push_[tag]()`` 和 ``pop()`` "
"函数对 RichTextLabel 所做的修改。"

msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考"

msgid ""
"*Some* of these BBCode tags can be used in tooltips for ``@export`` script "
"variables as well as in the XML source of the class reference. For more "
"information, see :ref:`Class reference BBCode <doc_class_reference_bbcode>`."
msgstr ""
"*部分* 这些 BBCode 标签同样可以用在脚本变量 ``@export`` 的工具提示"
"（tooltips）中，以及类参考（class reference）的 XML 源文件里。想了解更多信"
"息，请查看： :ref:`Class reference BBCode <doc_class_reference_bbcode>`。"

msgid "Tag"
msgstr "标签"

msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "**b**"
msgstr "**b**"

msgid ""
"Makes ``{text}`` use the bold (or bold italics) font of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "让 ``{text}`` 使用 ``RichTextLabel`` 的粗体（或者粗斜体）字体。"

msgid "``[b]{text}[/b]``"
msgstr "``[b]{text}[/b]``"

msgid "**i**"
msgstr "**i**"

msgid ""
"Makes ``{text}`` use the italics (or bold italics) font of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "让 ``{text}`` 使用 ``RichTextLabel`` 的斜体（或者粗斜体）字体。"

msgid "``[i]{text}[/i]``"
msgstr "``[i]{text}[/i]``"

msgid "**u**"
msgstr "**u**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` underlined."
msgstr "在 ``{text}`` 上显示下划线。"

msgid "``[u]{text}[/u]`` ``[u color={color}]{text}[/u]``"
msgstr "``[u]{text}[/u]`` ``[u color={color}]{text}[/u]``"

msgid "**s**"
msgstr "**s**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` strikethrough."
msgstr "在 ``{text}`` 上显示删除线。"

msgid "``[s]{text}[/s]`` ``[s color={color}]{text}[/s]``"
msgstr "``[s]{text}[/s]`` ``[s color={color}]{text}[/s]``"

msgid "**code**"
msgstr "**code**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` use the mono font of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "让 ``{text}`` 使用 ``RichTextLabel`` 的等宽字体。"

msgid "``[code]{text}[/code]``"
msgstr "``[code]{text}[/code]``"

msgid "**char**"
msgstr "**char**"

msgid "Adds Unicode character with hexadecimal UTF-32 ``{codepoint}``."
msgstr "将十六进制的 UTF-32 码位 ``{codepoint}`` 添加为 Unicode 字符。"

msgid "``[char={codepoint}]``"
msgstr "``[char={codepoint}]``"

msgid "**p**"
msgstr "**p**"

msgid ""
"Adds new paragraph with ``{text}``. Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_paragraph_options`."
msgstr ""
"将 ``{text}`` 添加为新的段落。支持配置选项，"
"见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_paragraph_options`\\ 。"

msgid "``[p]{text}[/p]``"
msgstr "``[p]{text}[/p]``"

msgid "``[p {options}]{text}[/p]``"
msgstr "``[p {options}]{text}[/p]``"

msgid "**br**"
msgstr "**br**"

msgid ""
"Adds line break in a text, without adding a new paragraph. If used within a "
"list, this won't create a new list item, but will add a line break within "
"the current item instead."
msgstr ""
"在文本中添加换行符，但不创建新段落。若在列表中使用，不会生成新的列表项，而是"
"在当前项内插入换行。"

msgid "``[br]``"
msgstr "``[br]``"

msgid "**hr**"
msgstr "**hr**"

msgid ""
"Adds new a horizontal rule to separate content. Supports configuration "
"options, see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hr_options`."
msgstr ""
"添加一条新的水平分割线（horizontal rule）来分隔内容。支持配置选项，详情请"
"见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hr_options` 。"

msgid "``[hr]``"
msgstr "``[hr]``"

msgid "``[hr {options}]``"
msgstr "``[hr {options}]``"

msgid "**center**"
msgstr "**center**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` horizontally centered."
msgstr "使得 ``{text}`` 水平居中。"

msgid "Same as ``[p align=center]``."
msgstr "等价于 ``[p align=center]``\\ 。"

msgid "``[center]{text}[/center]``"
msgstr "``[center]{text}[/center]``"

msgid "**left**"
msgstr "**left**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` horizontally left-aligned."
msgstr "使得 ``{text}`` 左对齐。"

msgid "Same as ``[p align=left]``."
msgstr "等价于 ``[p align=left]``\\ 。"

msgid "``[left]{text}[/left]``"
msgstr "``[left]{text}[/left]``"

msgid "**right**"
msgstr "**right**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` horizontally right-aligned."
msgstr "使得 ``{text}`` 右对齐。"

msgid "Same as ``[p align=right]``."
msgstr "等价于 ``[p align=right]``\\ 。"

msgid "``[right]{text}[/right]``"
msgstr "``[right]{text}[/right]``"

msgid "**fill**"
msgstr "**fill**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` fill the full width of ``RichTextLabel``."
msgstr "让 ``{text}`` 填满整个 ``RichTextLabel`` 的宽度。"

msgid "Same as ``[p align=fill]``."
msgstr "等价于 ``[p align=fill]``\\ 。"

msgid "``[fill]{text}[/fill]``"
msgstr "``[fill]{text}[/fill]``"

msgid "**indent**"
msgstr "**indent**"

msgid ""
"Indents ``{text}`` once. The indentation width is the same as with ``[ul]`` "
"or ``[ol]``, but without a bullet point."
msgstr ""
"单次缩进 ``{text}``\\ 。缩进宽度与 ``[ul]`` 或 ``[ol]`` 中相同，但不创建列表"
"点。"

msgid "``[indent]{text}[/indent]``"
msgstr "``[indent]{text}[/indent]``"

msgid "**url**"
msgstr "**url**"

msgid ""
"Creates a hyperlink (underlined and clickable text). Can contain optional "
"``{text}`` or display ``{link}`` as is. Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_url_options`."
msgstr ""
"创建一个超链接（带下划线且可点击的文本）。可以包含可选的 ``{text}`` 作为显示"
"文字，或者直接原样显示 ``{link}`` 。支持配置选项，详情请"
"见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_url_options` 。"

msgid ""
"**Must be handled with the \"meta_clicked\" signal to have an effect,** "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_url_tag_clicks`."
msgstr ""
"**必须配合 \"meta_clicked\" 信号来处理才能生效,** "
"看 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_handling_url_tag_clicks`."

msgid "``[url]{link}[/url]``"
msgstr "``[url]{link}[/url]``"

msgid "``[url={link}]{text}[/url]``"
msgstr "``[url={link}]{text}[/url]``"

msgid "``[url {options}]{text}[/url]``"
msgstr "``[url {options}]{text}[/url]``"

msgid "**hint**"
msgstr "**hint**"

msgid ""
"Creates a tooltip hint that is displayed when hovering the text with the "
"mouse. While not required, it's recommended to put tooltip text between "
"double or single quotes. Note that it is not possible to escape quotes using "
"``\\\"`` or ``\\'``. To use single quotes for apostrophes in the hint "
"string, you must use double quotes to surround the string."
msgstr ""
"当鼠标悬停在文字上时，会显示一个提示框（Tooltip）。虽然不是强制要求的，但强烈"
"建议使用双引号或单引号将提示文本括起来。需要注意的是，无法使用 ``\\\"`` 或 "
"``\\'`` 来转义引号。因此，如果你需要在提示文本中使用单引号（比如表示英文中的"
"撇号或缩写），就必须使用双引号来包裹整个字符串。"

msgid "``[hint=\"{tooltip text displayed on hover}\"]{text}[/hint]``"
msgstr "``[hint=\"{tooltip text displayed on hover}\"]{text}[/hint]``"

msgid "**img**"
msgstr "**img**"

msgid ""
"Inserts an image from the ``{path}`` (can be any "
"valid :ref:`class_Texture2D` resource)."
msgstr ""
"插入位于 ``{路径}`` 的图像（可以是任意有效的 :ref:`class_Texture2D` 资源）。"

msgid ""
"If ``{width}`` is provided, the image will try to fit that width maintaining "
"the aspect ratio."
msgstr "如果提供了 ``{宽度}``\\ ，图像会尝试在保持纵横比的前提下适配该宽度。"

msgid ""
"If both ``{width}`` and ``{height}`` are provided, the image will be scaled "
"to that size."
msgstr "如果同时提供了 ``{宽度}`` 和 ``{高度}``\\ ，图像会缩放至该大小。"

msgid ""
"Add ``%`` to the end of ``{width}`` or ``{height}`` value to specify it as "
"percentages of the control width instead of pixels."
msgstr ""
"在 ``{宽度}`` 和 ``{高度}`` 取值的末尾加上 ``%`` 可以指定控件宽高的百分比，而"
"不是像素。"

msgid ""
"Add ``em`` to the end of ``{width}`` or ``{height}`` value to specify it as "
"a ratio of the current font size. For example, ``height=1em`` will make the "
"image as tall as the surrounding text."
msgstr ""
"在 ``{width}`` 或 ``{height}`` 的数值末尾添加 ``em``，可将其指定为当前字体大"
"小的倍数。例如，``height=1em`` 会使图像的高度与周围文本的高度相同。"

msgid ""
"If ``{valign}`` configuration is provided, the image will try to align to "
"the surrounding text, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`."
msgstr ""
"如果提供了 ``{垂直对齐}`` 配置，图像会尝试与周围的文本对齐，"
"见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_options`."
msgstr "支持配置选项，见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_options`\\ 。"

msgid "``[img]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img]{路径}[/img]``"

msgid "``[img={width}]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img={宽度}]{路径}[/img]``"

msgid "``[img={width}x{height}]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img=<宽度>x<高度>]{路径}[/img]``"

msgid "``[img={valign}]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img={垂直对齐}]{路径}[/img]``"

msgid "``[img {options}]{path}[/img]``"
msgstr "``[img {选项}]{路径}[/img]``"

msgid "**font**"
msgstr "**font**"

msgid "Makes ``{text}`` use a font resource from the ``{path}``."
msgstr "为 ``{text}`` 使用位于 ``{路径}`` 的字体资源。"

msgid ""
"Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_font_options`."
msgstr "支持配置选项，见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_font_options`\\ 。"

msgid "``[font={path}]{text}[/font]``"
msgstr "``[font={路径}]{文本}[/font]``"

msgid "``[font {options}]{text}[/font]``"
msgstr "``[font {选项}]{文本}[/font]``"

msgid "**font_size**"
msgstr "**font_size**"

msgid "Use custom font size for ``{text}``."
msgstr "为 ``{text}`` 使用自定义字体大小。"

msgid "``[font_size={size}]{text}[/font_size]``"
msgstr "``[font_size={大小}]{文本}[/font_size]``"

msgid "**dropcap**"
msgstr "**dropcap**"

msgid ""
"Use a different font size and color for ``{text}``, while making the tag's "
"contents span multiple lines if it's large enough."
msgstr ""
"为 ``{text}`` 使用不同的字号和颜色；如果内容足够长，标签内的文字会自动跨行"
"（换行）显示。"

msgid ""
"A `drop cap <https://www.computerhope.com/jargon/d/dropcap.htm>`__ is "
"typically one uppercase character, but ``[dropcap]`` supports containing "
"multiple characters. ``margins`` values are comma-separated and can be "
"positive, zero or negative. Values must **not** be separated by spaces; "
"otherwise, the values won't be parsed correctly. Negative top and bottom "
"margins are particularly useful to allow the rest of the paragraph to "
"display below the dropcap."
msgstr ""
"首字下沉（ `drop cap <https://www.computerhope.com/jargon/d/"
"dropcap.htm>`__ ）通常只包含一个大写字母，但 ``[dropcap]`` 标签支持包含多个字"
"符。 ``margins`` （外边距）的数值需要用逗号分隔，可以是正数、零或负数。数值之"
"间绝对 **不能** 用空格隔开，否则这些数值将无法被正确解析。将顶部和底部的外边"
"距设置为负数会特别有用，因为这可以让段落中的其他文字显示在首字下沉字符的下方"
"（实现更紧凑的环绕效果）。"

msgid ""
"``[dropcap font={font} font_size={size} color={color} outline_size={size} "
"outline_color={color} margins={left},{top},{right},{bottom}]{text}[/"
"dropcap]``"
msgstr ""
"``[dropcap font={font} font_size={size} color={color} outline_size={size} "
"outline_color={color} margins={left},{top},{right},{bottom}]{text}[/"
"dropcap]``"

msgid "**opentype_features**"
msgstr "**opentype_features**"

msgid ""
"Enables custom OpenType font features for ``{text}``. Features must be "
"provided as a comma-separated ``{list}``. Values must **not** be separated "
"by spaces; otherwise, the list won't be parsed correctly."
msgstr ""
"为 ``{text}`` 启用自定义的 OpenType 字体特性。这些特性必须提供为一个以逗号分"
"隔的 ``{list}`` （列表）。数值之间绝对 **不能** 用空格隔开，否则列表将无法被"
"正确解析。"

msgid "``[opentype_features={list}]``"
msgstr "``[opentype_features={list}]``"

msgid "``{text}``"
msgstr "``{text}``"

msgid "``[/opentype_features]``"
msgstr "``[/opentype_features]``"

msgid "**lang**"
msgstr "**lang**"

msgid ""
"Overrides the language for ``{text}`` that is set by the **BiDi > Language** "
"property in :ref:`class_RichTextLabel`. ``{code}`` must be an "
"ISO :ref:`language code <doc_locales>`. This can be used to enforce the use "
"of a specific script for a language without starting a new paragraph. Some "
"font files may contain script-specific substitutes, in which case they will "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"覆盖 :ref:`class_RichTextLabel` 中 **BiDi > Language** 属性所设置的 ``{text}"
"`` 语言。 ``{code}`` 必须是一个 ISO :ref:`language code <doc_locales>` 。这可"
"以在不另起新段落的情况下，强制对某段文字使用特定的书写系统（script）。某些字"
"体文件可能包含针对特定书写系统的替换字形，在这种情况下，它们将会被调用。"

msgid "``[lang={code}]{text}[/lang]``"
msgstr "``[lang={code}]{text}[/lang]``"

msgid "**color**"
msgstr "**color**"

msgid ""
"Changes the color of ``{text}``. Color must be provided by a common name "
"(see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_named_colors`) or using the HEX "
"format (e.g. ``#ff00ff``, see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hex_colors`)."
msgstr ""
"修改 ``{text}`` 的颜色。设置的颜色必须使用通用名称"
"（见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_named_colors`\\ ）或十六进制格式（例"
"如 ``#ff00ff``\\ ，见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_hex_colors`\\ ）。"

msgid "``[color={code/name}]{text}[/color]``"
msgstr "``[color={code/name}]{text}[/color]``"

msgid "**bgcolor**"
msgstr "**bgcolor**"

msgid ""
"Draws the color behind ``{text}``. This can be used to highlight text. "
"Accepts same values as the ``color`` tag. By default, there is a slight "
"padding which is controlled by the ``text_highlight_h_padding`` and "
"``text_highlight_v_padding`` theme items in the RichTextLabel node. Set "
"padding to ``0`` to avoid potential overlapping issues when there are "
"background colors on neighboring lines/columns."
msgstr ""
"在 ``{text}`` 的后方绘制颜色。这可以用来高亮显示文本。它接受与 ``color`` 标签"
"相同的参数值。默认情况下，颜色块会带有一点内边距（padding），这个间距由 "
"RichTextLabel 节点中的 ``text_highlight_h_padding`` （水平内边距）和 "
"``text_highlight_v_padding`` （垂直内边距）这两个主题属性来控制。如果将内边距"
"设置为 ``0`` ，可以避免当相邻的行或列也存在背景色时，可能出现的重叠问题。"

msgid "``[bgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/bgcolor]``"
msgstr "``[bgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/bgcolor]``"

msgid "**fgcolor**"
msgstr "**fgcolor**"

msgid ""
"Draws the color in front of ``{text}``. This can be used to \"redact\" text "
"by using an opaque foreground color. Accepts same values as the ``color`` "
"tag. By default, there is a slight padding which is controlled by the "
"``text_highlight_h_padding`` and ``text_highlight_v_padding`` theme items in "
"the RichTextLabel node. Set padding to ``0`` to avoid potential overlapping "
"issues when there are foreground colors on neighboring lines/columns."
msgstr ""
"在 ``{text}`` 的前方绘制颜色。这可以用来通过设置不透明的前景色来‘涂黑/遮盖’文"
"本。它接受与 ``color`` 标签相同的参数值。默认情况下，会带有一点内边距"
"（padding），这个间距由 RichTextLabel 节点中的 ``text_highlight_h_padding`` "
"（水平内边距）和 ``text_highlight_v_padding`` （垂直内边距）这两个主题属性来"
"控制。如果将内边距设置为 ``0`` ，可以避免在相邻的行或列存在前景色时可能出现的"
"重叠问题。"

msgid "``[fgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/fgcolor]``"
msgstr "``[fgcolor={code/name}]{text}[/fgcolor]``"

msgid "**outline_size**"
msgstr "**outline_size**"

msgid "Use custom font outline size for ``{text}``."
msgstr "为 ``{text}`` 使用自定义字体轮廓大小。"

msgid "``[outline_size={size}]``"
msgstr "``[outline_size={size}]``"

msgid "``[/outline_size]``"
msgstr "``[/outline_size]``"

msgid "**outline_color**"
msgstr "**outline_color**"

msgid ""
"Use custom outline color for ``{text}``. Accepts same values as the "
"``color`` tag."
msgstr "为 ``{text}`` 使用自定义轮廓颜色。接受的值和 ``color`` 标签一致。"

msgid "``[outline_color={code/name}]``"
msgstr "``[outline_color={code/name}]``"

msgid "``[/outline_color]``"
msgstr "``[/outline_color]``"

msgid "**table**"
msgstr "**table**"

msgid ""
"Creates a table with the ``{number}`` of columns. Use the ``cell`` tag to "
"define table cells."
msgstr ""
"创建列数为 ``{number}`` 的表格。定义表格中的单元格请使用 ``cell`` 标签。"

msgid ""
"If ``{valign}`` configuration is provided, the table will try to align to "
"the surrounding text, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`."
msgstr ""
"如果提供了 ``{valign}`` （垂直对齐）配置，表格会尝试与周围的文本进行对齐，详"
"情请见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment` 。"

msgid ""
"If baseline alignment is used, the table is aligned to the baseline of the "
"row with index ``{alignment_row}`` (zero-based)."
msgstr ""
"如果使用了基线对齐，表格会按照索引为 ``{alignment_row}`` （从 0 开始计数）的"
"那一行的基线来进行对齐。"

msgid "``{name}`` is a table name for assistive apps (screen reader)."
msgstr "``{name}`` 是供辅助应用（屏幕阅读器）使用的表格名称。"

msgid "``[table={number}]{cells}[/table]``"
msgstr "``[table={number}]{cells}[/table]``"

msgid "``[table={number},{valign}]{cells}[/table]``"
msgstr "``[table={number},{valign}]{cells}[/table]``"

msgid "``[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row}]{cells}[/table]``"
msgstr "``[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row}]{cells}[/table]``"

msgid ""
"``[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row} name={name}]{cells}[/table]``"
msgstr ""
"``[table={number},{valign},{alignment_row} name={name}]{cells}[/table]``"

msgid "**cell**"
msgstr "**cell**"

msgid "Adds a cell with ``{text}`` to the table."
msgstr "向表格中添加一个文本为 ``{text}`` 的单元格。"

msgid ""
"If ``{ratio}`` is provided, the cell will try to expand to that value "
"proportionally to other cells and their ratio values."
msgstr ""
"如果提供了 ``{ratio}`` ，该单元格会尝试按照比例进行扩展，以匹配该值，同时也会"
"参考其他单元格及其比例值。"

msgid ""
"Supports configuration options, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_cell_options`."
msgstr ""
"支持配置选项，详情请见： :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_cell_options` 。"

msgid "``[cell]{text}[/cell]``"
msgstr "``[cell]{text}[/cell]``"

msgid "``[cell={ratio}]{text}[/cell]``"
msgstr "``[cell={ratio}]{text}[/cell]``"

msgid "``[cell {options}]{text}[/cell]``"
msgstr "``[cell {options}]{text}[/cell]``"

msgid "**ul**"
msgstr "**ul**"

msgid ""
"Adds an unordered list. List ``{items}`` must be provided by putting one "
"item per line of text."
msgstr "添加无序列表。列表项 ``{item}`` 必须以一行一个的形式提供。"

msgid ""
"The bullet point can be customized using the ``{bullet}`` parameter, "
"see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_unordered_list_bullet`."
msgstr ""
"项目符号可以使用 ``{bullet}`` 参数自定义，"
"见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_unordered_list_bullet`\\ 。"

msgid "``[ul]{items}[/ul]``"
msgstr "``[ul]{items}[/ul]``"

msgid "``[ul bullet={bullet}]{items}[/ul]``"
msgstr "``[ul bullet={bullet}]{items}[/ul]``"

msgid "**ol**"
msgstr "**ol**"

msgid ""
"Adds an ordered (numbered) list of the given ``{type}`` "
"(see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_list_types`). List ``{items}`` must "
"be provided by putting one item per line of text."
msgstr ""
"添加有序（编号）列表，类型由 ``{type}`` 给定"
"（见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_list_types`\\ ）。列表项 ``{items}`` "
"必须以一行一个的形式提供。"

msgid "``[ol type={type}]{items}[/ol]``"
msgstr "``[ol type={type}]{items}[/ol]``"

msgid "**lb**, **rb**"
msgstr "**lb**\\ 、\\ **rb**"

msgid "Adds ``[`` and ``]`` respectively. Allows escaping BBCode markup."
msgstr "分别添加 ``[`` 和 ``]``\\ 。用于转义 BBCode 标记。"

msgid ""
"These are self-closing tags, which means you do not need to close them (and "
"there is no ``[/lb]`` or ``[/rb]`` closing tag)."
msgstr ""
"这些是自闭合标签，不需要手动关闭（不存在 ``[/lb]`` 和 ``[/rb]`` 这种关闭标"
"签）。"

msgid "``[lb]b[rb]text[lb]/b[rb]`` will display as ``[b]text[/b]``."
msgstr "``[lb]b[rb]text[lb]/b[rb]`` 会被显示为 ``[b]text[/b]``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Several Unicode control characters can be added using their own self-closing "
"tags."
msgstr "部分 Unicode 控制字符可以使用对应的自闭合标签添加。"

msgid "This can result in easier maintenance compared to pasting those"
msgstr "相比于直接在文本中粘贴这些控制字符，"

msgid "control characters directly in the text."
msgstr "这种方法更方便维护。"

msgid ""
"``[lrm]`` (left-to-right mark), ``[rlm]`` (right-to-left mark), ``[lre]`` "
"(left-to-right embedding),"
msgstr ""
"``[lrm]`` （左到右标记）、 ``[rlm]`` （右到左标记）、 ``[lre]`` （左到右嵌"
"入）、"

msgid ""
"``[rle]`` (right-to-left embedding), ``[lro]`` (left-to-right override), "
"``[rlo]`` (right-to-left override),"
msgstr ""
"``[rle]`` （从右到左嵌入）， ``[lro]`` （从左到右覆盖）， ``[rlo]`` （从右到"
"左覆盖），"

msgid ""
"``[pdf]`` (pop directional formatting), ``[alm]`` (Arabic letter mark), "
"``[lri]`` (left-to-right isolate),"
msgstr ""
"``[pdf]`` （弹出方向格式）， ``[alm]`` （阿拉伯字母标记）， ``[lri]`` （从左"
"到右隔离），"

msgid ""
"``[rli]`` (right-to-left isolate), ``[fsi]`` (first strong isolate), "
"``[pdi]`` (pop directional isolate),"
msgstr ""
"``[rli]`` (从右向左隔离符), ``[fsi]`` (首个强字符隔离符), ``[pdi]`` (弹出方向"
"隔离符),"

msgid ""
"``[zwj]`` (zero-width joiner), ``[zwnj]`` (zero-width non-joiner), ``[wj]`` "
"(word joiner),"
msgstr ""
"``[zwj]`` (零宽连接符), ``[zwnj]`` (零宽非连接符), ``[wj]`` (词连接符),"

msgid "``[shy]`` (soft hyphen)"
msgstr "``[shy]`` (软连字符)"

msgid ""
"Tags for bold (``[b]``) and italics (``[i]``) formatting work best if the "
"appropriate custom fonts are set up in the RichTextLabelNode's theme "
"overrides. If no custom bold or italic fonts are defined, `faux bold and "
"italic fonts <https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/"
"faux_fake_pseudo_synthesized>`__ will be generated by Godot. These fonts "
"rarely look good in comparison to hand-made bold/italic font variants."
msgstr ""
"如果想要让粗体（ ``[b]`` ）和斜体（ ``[i]`` ）标签达到最好的显示效果，最好在 "
"RichTextLabel 节点的主题覆盖（theme overrides）中设置好对应的自定义字体。如果"
"没有定义专门的粗体或斜体字体，Godot 就会自动生成 `faux bold and italic fonts "
"<https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/"
"faux_fake_pseudo_synthesized>`__ 。和专门手工设计的粗体/斜体字体变体相比，这"
"些自动生成的字体效果通常都不太好看。"

msgid ""
"The monospaced (``[code]``) tag **only** works if a custom font is set up in "
"the RichTextLabel node's theme overrides. Otherwise, monospaced text will "
"use the regular font."
msgstr ""
"等宽（ ``[code]`` ）标签 **只有** 在 RichTextLabel 节点的主题覆盖（theme "
"overrides）中设置了自定义字体时才会生效。否则，等宽文本将直接使用普通的常规字"
"体。"

msgid "There are no BBCode tags to control vertical centering of text yet."
msgstr "目前还没有用于控制文本垂直居中的BBCode标签."

msgid "Options can be skipped for all tags."
msgstr "所有标签（tags）都可以跳过这些选项。"

msgid "Paragraph options"
msgstr "段落选项"

msgid "**align**"
msgstr "**align**"

msgid ""
"``left`` (or ``l``), ``center`` (or ``c``), ``right`` (or ``r``), ``fill`` "
"(or ``f``)"
msgstr ""
"``left`` (or ``l``), ``center`` (or ``c``), ``right`` (or ``r``), ``fill`` "
"(or ``f``)"

msgid "``left``"
msgstr "``left``"

msgid "Text horizontal alignment."
msgstr "文本水平对齐。"

msgid "**bidi_override**, **st**"
msgstr "**bidi_override**\\ 、\\ **st**"

msgid ""
"``default`` (of ``d``), ``uri`` (or ``u``), ``file`` (or ``f``), ``email`` "
"(or ``e``), ``list`` (or ``l``), ``none`` (or ``n``), ``custom`` (or ``c``)"
msgstr ""
"``default`` (of ``d``), ``uri`` (or ``u``), ``file`` (or ``f``), ``email`` "
"(or ``e``), ``list`` (or ``l``), ``none`` (or ``n``), ``custom`` (or ``c``)"

msgid "``default``"
msgstr "``default``"

msgid "Structured text override."
msgstr "结构化文本覆盖。"

msgid "**justification_flags**, **jst**"
msgstr "**justification_flags**\\ 、\\ **jst**"

msgid "``word,kashida,skip_last,do_not_skip_single``"
msgstr "``word,kashida,skip_last,do_not_skip_single``"

msgid ""
"Justification (fill alignment) option. See :ref:`class_TextServer` for more "
"details."
msgstr "两端对齐（填充对齐）选项。详见 :ref:`class_TextServer`\\ 。"

msgid "**direction**, **dir**"
msgstr "**direction**\\ 、\\ **dir**"

msgid "``ltr`` (or ``l``), ``rtl`` (or ``r``), ``auto`` (or ``a``)"
msgstr "``ltr`` (或 ``l``), ``rtl`` (或 ``r``), ``auto`` (或 ``a``)"

msgid "Inherit"
msgstr "继承"

msgid "Base BiDi direction."
msgstr "基础双向（BiDi）文本方向。"

msgid "**language**, **lang**"
msgstr "**language**\\ 、\\ **lang**"

msgid "ISO language codes. See :ref:`doc_locales`"
msgstr "ISO 语言代码。见 :ref:`doc_locales`"

msgid ""
"Locale override. Some font files may contain script-specific substitutes, in "
"which case they will be used."
msgstr ""
"区域设置覆盖。有些字体文件可能包含针对特定书写系统（script）的替代字形，如果"
"包含的话，这些字形将会被使用。"

msgid "**tab_stops**"
msgstr "**tab_stops**"

msgid "List of floating-point numbers, e.g. ``10.0,30.0``"
msgstr "浮点数列表，例如 ``10.0,30.0``"

msgid "Width of the space character in the font"
msgstr "字体中空格字符的宽度"

msgid ""
"Overrides the horizontal offsets for each tab character. When the end of the "
"list is reached, the tab stops will loop over. For example, if you set "
"``tab_stops`` to ``10.0,30.0``, the first tab will be at ``10`` pixels, the "
"second tab will be at ``10 + 30 = 40`` pixels, and the third tab will be at "
"``10 + 30 + 10 = 50`` pixels from the origin of the RichTextLabel."
msgstr ""
"覆盖每个制表符（Tab）字符的水平偏移量。当到达列表末尾时，制表符的停靠位置会循"
"环重复。例如，如果你将 ``tab_stops`` 设置为 ``10.0,30.0`` ，那么从 "
"RichTextLabel 的起始位置算起，第一个制表符会停在 ``10`` 像素处，第二个制表符"
"会停在 ``10 + 30 = 40`` 像素处，而第三个制表符会停在 ``10 + 30 + 10 = 50`` 像"
"素处。"

msgid "Handling ``[url]`` tag clicks"
msgstr "处理 ``[url]`` 标签点击"

msgid ""
"By default, ``[url]`` tags do nothing when clicked. This is to allow "
"flexible use of ``[url]`` tags rather than limiting them to opening URLs in "
"a web browser."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，\\ ``[url]`` 标签在单击时不执行任何操作.这是为了允许灵活使用 "
"``[url]`` 标签，而不是限制它们在Web浏览器中打开URL."

msgid ""
"To handle clicked ``[url]`` tags, connect the ``RichTextLabel`` "
"node's :ref:`meta_clicked <class_RichTextLabel_signal_meta_clicked>` signal "
"to a script function."
msgstr ""
"要处理被点击的 ``[url]`` 标签，需要将 ``RichTextLabel`` 节点"
"的 :ref:`meta_clicked <class_RichTextLabel_signal_meta_clicked>` 信号连接到一"
"个脚本函数上。"

msgid ""
"For example, the following method can be connected to ``meta_clicked`` to "
"open clicked URLs using the user's default web browser:"
msgstr ""
"例如，可以将以下方法连接到 ``meta_clicked`` 信号，从而使用用户默认的网页浏览"
"器来打开被点击的链接（URL）："

msgid ""
"For more advanced use cases, it's also possible to store JSON in a ``[url]`` "
"tag's option and parse it in the function that handles the ``meta_clicked`` "
"signal. For example:"
msgstr ""
"对于更高级的用例，也可以将 JSON 数据存储在 ``[url]`` 标签的选项（option）里，"
"然后在处理 ``meta_clicked`` 信号的函数中对其进行解析。例如："

msgid "Horizontal rule options"
msgstr "水平分隔线选项"

msgid "Color name or color in HEX format"
msgstr "颜色名称或十六进制格式的颜色"

msgid "``Color(1, 1, 1, 1)``"
msgstr "``Color(1, 1, 1, 1)``"

msgid "Color tint of the rule (modulation)."
msgstr "分隔线的颜色色调（调制）。"

msgid "**height**"
msgstr "**height**"

msgid "Integer number"
msgstr "整数"

msgid "``2``"
msgstr "``2``"

msgid ""
"Target height of the rule in pixels, add ``%`` to the end of value to "
"specify it as percentages of the control width instead of pixels."
msgstr ""
"分隔线的目标高度（以像素为单位）。如果在数值的末尾加上 ``%`` ，就可以将其指定"
"为控件宽度的百分比，而不是像素。"

msgid "**width**"
msgstr "**width**"

msgid "``90%``"
msgstr "``90%``"

msgid ""
"Target width of the rule in pixels, add ``%`` to the end of value to specify "
"it as percentages of the control width instead of pixels."
msgstr ""
"分隔线的目标宽度（以像素为单位）。如果在数值的末尾加上 ``%`` ，就可以将其指定"
"为控件宽度的百分比，而不是像素。"

msgid "``left`` (or ``l``), ``center`` (or ``c``), ``right`` (or ``r``)"
msgstr "``left`` (或 ``l``), ``center`` (或 ``c``), ``right`` (或 ``r``)"

msgid "Horizontal alignment."
msgstr "水平对齐。"

msgid "URL options"
msgstr "URL 选项"

msgid "**underline**"
msgstr "**underline**"

msgid "``always``, ``never``, ``hover``"
msgstr "``always``, ``never``, ``hover``"

msgid "``always``"
msgstr "``always``"

msgid "URL underlining mode."
msgstr "URL 下划线模式。"

msgid "**tooltip**"
msgstr "**tooltip**"

msgid "String."
msgstr "字符串。"

msgid "URL tooltip."
msgstr "URL 工具提示。"

msgid "**href**"
msgstr "**href**"

msgid "URL target address."
msgstr "URL 目标地址。"

msgid "Image options"
msgstr "图像选项"

msgid "Color tint of the image (modulation)."
msgstr "图像的着色颜色（调制）。"

msgid "Floating-point number"
msgstr "浮点数"

msgid "Target height of the image in pixels."
msgstr "图像的目标高度，单位是像素。"

msgid "Alternative units to pixels can be specified:"
msgstr "也可以指定像素以外的其他单位："

msgid ""
"Add ``%`` to the end of the value to specify it as a percentage of the "
"control width instead of pixels. For example, ``height=50%`` will make the "
"image half as tall as the control is wide."
msgstr ""
"在值的末尾添加 ``%``，将其指定为控件宽度的百分比，而不是像素。例如，"
"``height=50%`` 会使图像的高度变为控件宽度的一半。"

msgid ""
"Add ``em`` to the end of the value to specify it as a ratio of the "
"surrounding font size instead of pixels. For example, ``height=1em`` will "
"make the image as tall as the surrounding text."
msgstr ""
"在数值的末尾加上 ``em`` ，就可以把它指定为相对于周围字体大小的比例，而不是固"
"定的像素。举个例子，如果你设置 ``height=1em`` ，那么这张图片的高度就会变得和"
"周围的文字一模一样高。"

msgid "Target width of the image in pixels."
msgstr "图像的目标宽度（以像素为单位）。"

msgid ""
"Add ``%`` to the end of the value to specify it as a percentage of the "
"control width instead of pixels. For example, ``width=50%`` will make the "
"image take up half of the control width."
msgstr ""
"在值的末尾添加 ``%``，将其指定为控件宽度的百分比，而不是像素。例如，"
"``width=50%`` 会使图像占据控件宽度的一半。"

msgid ""
"Add ``em`` to the end of the value to specify it as a ratio of the "
"surrounding font size instead of pixels. For example, ``width=1em`` will "
"make the image as wide as the surrounding text is tall."
msgstr ""
"在数值的末尾加上 ``em`` ，就可以把它指定为相对于周围字体大小的比例，而不是固"
"定的像素。举个例子，如果你设置 ``width=1em`` ，那么这张图片的宽度就会变得和周"
"围文字的高度一模一样。"

msgid "**region**"
msgstr "**region**"

msgid "x,y,width,height in pixels"
msgstr "x,y,width,height（单位：像素）"

msgid ""
"Region rect of the image. This can be used to display a single image from a "
"spritesheet."
msgstr "图像的区域框。可用于显示精灵表中的单个图像。"

msgid "**pad**"
msgstr "**pad**"

msgid "``false``, ``true``"
msgstr "``false``\\ 、\\ ``true``"

msgid "``false``"
msgstr "``false``"

msgid ""
"If set to ``true``, and the image is smaller than the size specified by "
"``width`` and ``height``, the image padding is added to match the size "
"instead of upscaling."
msgstr ""
"如果设为 ``true`` 且图像小于 ``width`` 和 ``height`` 指定的大小，那么就会为图"
"像加上边距让大小一致，不会进行缩放。"

msgid "String"
msgstr "字符串"

msgid "Image tooltip."
msgstr "图像的工具提示。"

msgid "see :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`"
msgstr "见 :ref:`doc_bbcode_in_richtextlabel_image_and_table_alignment`"

msgid "``center,center``"
msgstr "``center,center``"

msgid "Image alignment to the surrounding text."
msgstr "图像相对于周围文本的对齐方式。"

msgid "**alt**"
msgstr "**alt**"

msgid "Image description for assistive apps (screen reader)."
msgstr "供辅助应用（屏幕阅读器）使用的图像描述。"

msgid "Image and table vertical alignment"
msgstr "图像和表格的垂直对齐"

msgid ""
"When a vertical alignment value is provided with the ``[img]`` or "
"``[table]`` tag the image/table will try to align itself against the "
"surrounding text. Alignment is performed using a vertical point of the image "
"and a vertical point of the text. There are 3 possible points on the image "
"(``top``, ``center``, and ``bottom``) and 4 possible points on the text and "
"table (``top``, ``center``, ``baseline``, and ``bottom``), which can be used "
"in any combination."
msgstr ""
"当在 ``[img]`` 或 ``[table]`` 标签中提供垂直对齐值时，图片/表格会尝试根据周围"
"的文本进行对齐。这种对齐是通过结合图片上的一个垂直点和文本上的一个垂直点来实"
"现的。图片上有 3 个可选的点（ ``top`` 顶部、 ``center`` 居中、 ``bottom`` 底"
"部），而文本和表格上有 4 个可选的点（ ``top`` 顶部、 ``center`` 居中、 "
"``baseline`` 基线、 ``bottom`` 底部），你可以将它们进行任意组合使用。"

msgid ""
"To specify both points, use their full or short names as a value of the "
"image/table tag:"
msgstr ""
"如果要同时指定两个点，请将它们的全称或简写作为图片或表格标签的值来使用："

msgid ""
"You can also specify just one value (``top``, ``center``, or ``bottom``) to "
"make use of a corresponding preset (``top-top``, ``center-center``, and "
"``bottom-bottom`` respectively)."
msgstr ""
"你也可以只指定一个值（ ``top`` 、 ``center`` 或 ``bottom`` ），这样就会自动使"
"用对应的预设值（分别对应 ``top-top`` 、 ``center-center`` 和 ``bottom-"
"bottom`` ）。"

msgid ""
"Short names for the values are ``t`` (``top``), ``c`` (``center``), ``l`` "
"(``baseline``), and ``b`` (``bottom``)."
msgstr ""
"这些值的简写分别是 ``t`` （ ``top`` ）、 ``c`` （ ``center`` ）、 ``l`` "
"（ ``baseline`` ）和 ``b`` （ ``bottom`` ）。"

msgid "Font options"
msgstr "字体选项"

msgid "**name**, **n**"
msgstr "**name**\\ 、\\ **n**"

msgid "A valid Font resource path."
msgstr "有效的 Font 资源路径。"

msgid "Font resource path."
msgstr "字体资源路径。"

msgid "**size**, **s**"
msgstr "**size**\\ 、\\ **s**"

msgid "Number in pixels."
msgstr "数字，单位为像素。"

msgid "Custom font size."
msgstr "自定义字体大小。"

msgid "**glyph_spacing**, **gl**"
msgstr "**glyph_spacing**\\ 、\\ **gl**"

msgid "Extra spacing for each glyph."
msgstr "每个字形的额外间距。"

msgid "**space_spacing**, **sp**"
msgstr "**space_spacing**, **sp**"

msgid "Extra spacing for the space character."
msgstr "空格字符的额外间距。"

msgid "**top_spacing**, **top**"
msgstr "**top_spacing**\\ 、\\ **top**"

msgid "Extra spacing at the top of the line."
msgstr "行上方的额外间距。"

msgid "**bottom_spacing**, **bt**"
msgstr "**bottom_spacing**\\ 、\\ **bt**"

msgid "Extra spacing at the bottom of the line."
msgstr "行下方的额外间距。"

msgid "**embolden**, **emb**"
msgstr "**embolden**\\ 、\\ **emb**"

msgid "Floating-point number."
msgstr "浮点数字。"

msgid "``0.0``"
msgstr "``0.0``"

msgid ""
"Font embolden strength, if it is not equal to zero, emboldens the font "
"outlines. Negative values reduce the outline thickness."
msgstr "字体加粗强度，非零时会加粗字体的轮廓。负值会降低轮廓的粗细。"

msgid "**face_index**, **fi**"
msgstr "**face_index**\\ 、\\ **fi**"

msgid "Integer number."
msgstr "整数。"

msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

msgid "An active face index in the TrueType / OpenType collection."
msgstr "TrueType / OpenType 合集中活动字体的索引号。"

msgid "**slant**, **sln**"
msgstr "**slant**\\ 、\\ **sln**"

msgid ""
"Font slant strength, positive values slant glyphs to the right. Negative "
"values to the left."
msgstr "字体倾斜强度，正值会将字形向右倾斜，负值会将字形向左倾斜。"

msgid "**opentype_variation**, **otv**"
msgstr "**opentype_variation**\\ 、\\ **otv**"

msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of the OpenType variation tags (no space after each "
"comma)."
msgstr "用逗号分隔的 OpenType 可变字体标签列表（每个逗号后面不要加空格）。"

msgid ""
"Font OpenType variation coordinates. See `OpenType variation tags <https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/dvaraxisreg>`__."
msgstr ""
"字体的 OpenType 变体坐标。见 `OpenType 变体标签 <https://docs.microsoft.com/"
"en-us/typography/opentype/spec/dvaraxisreg>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Note: The value should be enclosed in ``\"`` to allow using ``=`` inside it:"
msgstr "注意：取值应使用 ``\"`` 包裹，这样就能够在其中使用 ``=``\\ ："

msgid "**opentype_features**, **otf**"
msgstr "**opentype_features**\\ 、\\ **otf**"

msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of the OpenType feature tags (no space after each "
"comma)."
msgstr "用逗号分隔的 OpenType 特性标签列表（每个逗号后面不要加空格）。"

msgid ""
"Font OpenType features. See `OpenType features tags <https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/featuretags>`__."
msgstr ""
"字体的 OpenType 特性。见 `OpenType 特性标签 <https://docs.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/typography/opentype/spec/featuretags>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Named colors"
msgstr "具名颜色"

msgid "See this image for a list of color constants:"
msgstr "关于颜色常量的列表，请查看这张图片："

msgid ""
"`View at full size <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/"
"master/img/color_constants.png>`__"
msgstr ""
"`查看完整尺寸 <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/"
"master/img/color_constants.png>`__"

msgid "Hexadecimal color codes"
msgstr "十六进制颜色代码"

msgid ""
"For opaque RGB colors, any valid 6-digit hexadecimal code is supported, e.g. "
"``[color=#ffffff]white[/color]``. Shorthand RGB color codes such as ``#6f2`` "
"(equivalent to ``#66ff22``) are also supported."
msgstr ""
"对于不透明的 RGB 颜色，支持任何有效的 6 位十六进制代码，例如 "
"``[color=#ffffff]white[/color]`` 。同时也支持简写的 RGB 颜色代码，比如 "
"``#6f2`` （它等同于 ``#66ff22`` ）。"

msgid ""
"For transparent RGB colors, any RGBA 8-digit hexadecimal code can be used, "
"e.g. ``[color=#ffffff88]translucent white[/color]``. Note that the alpha "
"channel is the **last** component of the color code, not the first one. "
"Short RGBA color codes such as ``#6f28`` (equivalent to ``#66ff2288``) are "
"supported as well."
msgstr ""
"对于带透明度的 RGB 颜色，可以使用任何 8 位的 RGBA 十六进制代码，例如 "
"``[color=#ffffff88]translucent white[/color]`` 。需要注意的是，Alpha 通道（即"
"透明度）是颜色代码的 **最后** 一部分，而不是第一部分。此外，也支持简写的 "
"RGBA 颜色代码，比如 ``#6f28`` （等同于 ``#66ff2288`` ）。"

msgid "Cell options"
msgstr "单元格选项"

msgid "**shrink**"
msgstr "**shrink**"

msgid "``true``"
msgstr "``true``"

msgid "If ``true``, cell can shrink to its contents."
msgstr "若为 ``true``，单元格可收缩至其内容大小。"

msgid "**expand**"
msgstr "**expand**"

msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

msgid ""
"Cell expansion ratio. This defines which cells will try to expand to "
"proportionally to other cells and their expansion ratios."
msgstr ""
"单元格扩张比例。定义的是哪些单元格会尝试按比例扩展到其他单元格，以及相应的扩"
"张比例。"

msgid "**border**"
msgstr "**border**"

msgid "Cell border color."
msgstr "单元格边框颜色。"

msgid "**bg**"
msgstr "**bg**"

msgid ""
"Cell background color. For alternating odd/even row backgrounds, you can use "
"``bg=odd_color,even_color``."
msgstr ""
"单元格背景色。如果想要单双行使用不同的背景色，请使用 ``bg=单行颜色,双行颜色"
"``\\ 。"

msgid "**padding**"
msgstr "**padding**"

msgid "4 comma-separated floating-point numbers (no space after each comma)"
msgstr "4个用逗号分隔的浮点数（每个逗号后面不要加空格）"

msgid "``0,0,0,0``"
msgstr "``0,0,0,0``"

msgid "Left, top, right, and bottom cell padding."
msgstr "单元格左侧、上方、右侧、下方的内边距。"

msgid "Unordered list bullet"
msgstr "无序列表项目符号"

msgid ""
"By default, the ``[ul]`` tag uses the ``U+2022`` \"Bullet\" Unicode glyph as "
"the bullet character. This behavior is similar to web browsers. The bullet "
"character can be customized using ``[ul bullet={bullet}]``. If provided, "
"this ``{bullet}`` parameter must be a string with no enclosing quotes (for "
"example, ``[bullet=*]``). You can add trailing spaces after the bullet "
"character to increase the spacing between the bullet and the list item text."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下， ``[ul]`` 标签会使用 Unicode 字符 ``U+2022`` （即 \"Bullet\" 实心"
"圆点）作为列表的项目符号。这个表现和网页浏览器里的默认效果非常相似。你可以通"
"过 ``[ul bullet={bullet}]`` 的格式来自定义项目符号。如果提供了这个 ``{bullet}"
"`` 参数，它必须是一个没有加引号的字符串（例如 ``[bullet=*]`` ）。你还可以在项"
"目符号后面加上空格，来增加符号和列表文字之间的间距。"

msgid ""
"See `Bullet (typography) on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Bullet_(typography)>`__ for a list of common bullet characters that you can "
"paste directly in the ``bullet`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"关于可以直接复制并粘贴到 ``bullet`` 参数中的常用项目符号列表，请参阅维基百科"
"上的 项目符号（排版） <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bullet_(typography)>__ "
"页面。"

msgid "Ordered list types"
msgstr "有序列表类型"

msgid ""
"Ordered lists can be used to automatically mark items with numbers or "
"letters in ascending order. This tag supports the following type options:"
msgstr "有序列表可以使用数字或字母自动升序标记条目。该标签支持以下类型选项："

msgid "``1`` - Numbers, using language specific numbering system if possible."
msgstr "``1`` - 数字，会尽量使用语言对应的数字系统。"

msgid "``a``, ``A`` - Lower and upper case Latin letters."
msgstr "``a``\\ 、\\ ``A`` - 小写和大写拉丁字母。"

msgid "``i``, ``I`` - Lower and upper case Roman numerals."
msgstr "``i``\\ 、\\ ``I`` - 小写和大写罗马数字。"

msgid "Text effects"
msgstr "文本效果"

msgid ""
"BBCode can also be used to create different text effects that can optionally "
"be animated. Several customizable effects are provided out of the box, and "
"you can easily create your own. By default, animated effects will "
"pause :ref:`when the SceneTree is paused <doc_pausing_games>`. You can "
"change this behavior by adjusting the RichTextLabel's **Process > Mode** "
"property."
msgstr ""
"BBCode 还可以用来创建各种不同的文字特效，并且你可以选择是否让这些特效带有动"
"画。Godot 引擎开箱即用地提供了好几种可以自定义的特效，而且你也可以非常轻松地"
"创建属于你自己的特效。默认情况下， :ref:`when the SceneTree is paused "
"<doc_pausing_games>` ，带有动画的特效也会跟着暂停。你可以通过调整 "
"RichTextLabel 节点的 **Process > Mode** （处理 > 模式） 属性来改变这一行为。"

msgid ""
"All examples below mention the default values for options in the listed tag "
"format."
msgstr "下面所有的示例中，列出的标签格式里提到的选项值均为默认值。"

msgid ""
"Text effects that move characters' positions may result in characters being "
"clipped by the RichTextLabel node bounds."
msgstr ""
"那些会移动字符位置的文字特效，可能会导致字符被 RichTextLabel 节点的边界给‘截"
"断’（也就是显示不全）。"

msgid ""
"You can resolve this by disabling **Control > Layout > Clip Contents** in "
"the inspector after selecting the RichTextLabel node, or ensuring there is "
"enough margin added around the text by using line breaks above and below the "
"line using the effect."
msgstr ""
"你可以通过以下两种方法来解决这个问题：在选中 RichTextLabel 节点后，在检查器"
"（Inspector）中关闭 **Control > Layout > Clip Contents** （裁剪内容） 选项；"
"或者，在使用该特效的那一行文字的上方和下方添加换行符，确保文字周围留有足够的"
"边距。"

msgid "Pulse"
msgstr "脉冲"

msgid ""
"Pulse creates an animated pulsing effect that multiplies each character's "
"opacity and color. It can be used to bring attention to specific text. Its "
"tag format is ``[pulse freq=1.0 color=#ffffff40 ease=-2.0]{text}[/pulse]``."
msgstr ""
"Pulse（脉冲）特效能创建一个动态的脉冲效果，它会同时改变（乘算）每个字符的透明"
"度和颜色。这个特效非常适合用来突出显示某些特定的文本。它的标签格式为 "
"``[pulse freq=1.0 color=#ffffff40 ease=-2.0]{text}[/pulse]`` 。"

msgid ""
"``freq`` controls the frequency of the half-pulsing cycle (higher is "
"faster). A full pulsing cycle takes ``2 * (1.0 / freq)`` seconds. ``color`` "
"is the target color multiplier for blinking. The default mostly fades out "
"text, but not entirely. ``ease`` is the easing function exponent to use. "
"Negative values provide in-out easing, which is why the default is ``-2.0``."
msgstr ""
"``freq`` 控制半脉冲循环的频率（数值越大，闪烁越快）。一个完整的脉冲循环需要 "
"``2 * (1.0 / freq)`` 秒。 ``color`` 是闪烁时的目标颜色乘数。默认值会让文字大"
"部分淡出，但不会完全消失。 ``ease`` 是要使用的缓动函数指数。负数会提供 in-out"
"（进出）缓动效果，这也是为什么默认值设为 ``-2.0`` 的原因。"

msgid "Wave"
msgstr "波浪"

msgid ""
"Wave makes the text go up and down. Its tag format is ``[wave amp=50.0 "
"freq=5.0 connected=1]{text}[/wave]``."
msgstr ""
"Wave（波浪）特效能让文字上下起伏移动。它的标签格式为 ``[wave amp=50.0 "
"freq=5.0 connected=1]{text}[/wave]`` 。"

msgid ""
"``amp`` controls how high and low the effect goes, and ``freq`` controls how "
"fast the text goes up and down. A ``freq`` value of ``0`` will result in no "
"visible waves, and negative ``freq`` values won't display any waves either. "
"If ``connected`` is ``1`` (default), glyphs with ligatures will be moved "
"together. If ``connected`` is ``0``, each glyph is moved individually even "
"if they are joined by ligatures. This can work around certain rendering "
"issues with font ligatures."
msgstr ""
"``amp`` 控制特效的高低幅度（也就是波浪起伏的大小），而 ``freq`` 则控制文字上"
"下波动的速度。如果 ``freq`` 设为 ``0`` ，将不会产生可见的波浪；如果 ``freq`` "
"设为负数，同样也不会显示波浪。如果 ``connected`` 设为 ``1`` （默认值），带有"
"连字（ligatures）的字形会被当作一个整体一起移动。如果 ``connected`` 设为 "
"``0`` ，即使字形之间通过连字连在一起，每个字形也会被单独移动。这可以用来规避"
"某些字体连字导致的渲染问题。"

msgid "Tornado"
msgstr "旋风"

msgid ""
"Tornado makes the text move around in a circle. Its tag format is ``[tornado "
"radius=10.0 freq=1.0 connected=1]{text}[/tornado]``."
msgstr ""
"Tornado（龙卷风）特效会让文字绕着圈移动。它的标签格式为 ``[tornado "
"radius=10.0 freq=1.0 connected=1]{text}[/tornado]`` 。"

msgid ""
"``radius`` is the radius of the circle that controls the offset, ``freq`` is "
"how fast the text moves in a circle. A ``freq`` value of ``0`` will pause "
"the animation, while negative ``freq`` will play the animation backwards. If "
"``connected`` is ``1`` (default), glyphs with ligatures will be moved "
"together. If ``connected`` is ``0``, each glyph is moved individually even "
"if they are joined by ligatures. This can work around certain rendering "
"issues with font ligatures."
msgstr ""
"``radius`` 是控制文字偏移范围的圆形半径（也就是文字绕圈的大小）， ``freq`` 则"
"决定了文字绕圈移动的速度。如果 ``freq`` 设为 ``0`` ，动画会暂停；如果 "
"``freq`` 设为负数，动画则会倒着播放。如果 ``connected`` 设为 ``1`` （默认"
"值），带有连字（ligatures）的字形会被当作一个整体一起移动。如果 "
"``connected`` 设为 ``0`` ，即使字形之间通过连字连在一起，每个字形也会被单独移"
"动。这可以用来规避某些字体连字导致的渲染问题。"

msgid "Shake"
msgstr "抖动"

msgid ""
"Shake makes the text shake. Its tag format is ``[shake rate=20.0 level=5 "
"connected=1]{text}[/shake]``."
msgstr ""
"Shake（抖动）特效能让文字产生抖动的效果。它的标签格式为 ``[shake rate=20.0 "
"level=5 connected=1]{text}[/shake]`` 。"

msgid ""
"``rate`` controls how fast the text shakes, ``level`` controls how far the "
"text is offset from the origin. If ``connected`` is ``1`` (default), glyphs "
"with ligatures will be moved together. If ``connected`` is ``0``, each glyph "
"is moved individually even if they are joined by ligatures. This can work "
"around certain rendering issues with font ligatures."
msgstr ""
"``rate`` 控制文字抖动的速度， ``level`` 控制文字偏离原始位置的距离（也就是抖"
"动的幅度）。如果 ``connected`` 设为 ``1`` （默认值），带有连字（ligatures）的"
"字形会被当作一个整体一起移动。如果 ``connected`` 设为 ``0`` ，即使字形之间通"
"过连字连在一起，每个字形也会被单独移动。这可以用来规避某些字体连字导致的渲染"
"问题。"

msgid "Fade"
msgstr "渐隐"

msgid ""
"Fade creates a static fade effect that multiplies each character's opacity. "
"Its tag format is ``[fade start=4 length=14]{text}[/fade]``."
msgstr ""
"Fade（淡出）特效会创建一个静态的淡出效果，它会直接对每个字符的透明度（不透明"
"度）进行乘法混合。它的标签格式为 ``[fade start=4 length=14]{text}[/fade]`` 。"

msgid ""
"``start`` controls the starting position of the falloff relative to where "
"the fade command is inserted, ``length`` controls over how many characters "
"should the fade out take place."
msgstr ""
"``start`` 控制衰减（淡出）的起始位置，它是相对于你插入 fade 命令的位置来计算"
"的； ``length`` 则控制淡出效果要跨越多少个字符来完成。"

msgid "Rainbow"
msgstr "彩虹"

msgid ""
"Rainbow gives the text a rainbow color that changes over time. Its tag "
"format is ``[rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]{text}[/rainbow]``."
msgstr ""
"Rainbow（彩虹）特效能让文字呈现出随时间变化的彩虹色。它的标签格式为 "
"``[rainbow freq=1.0 sat=0.8 val=0.8 speed=1.0]{text}[/rainbow]`` 。"

msgid ""
"``freq`` determines how many letters the rainbow extends over before it "
"repeats itself, ``sat`` is the saturation of the rainbow, ``val`` is the "
"value of the rainbow. ``speed`` is the number of full rainbow cycles per "
"second. A positive ``speed`` value will play the animation forwards, a value "
"of ``0`` will pause the animation, and a negative ``speed`` value will play "
"the animation backwards."
msgstr ""
"``freq`` 决定了彩虹颜色在重复之前会跨越多少个字（也就是彩虹周期的长度）， "
"``sat`` 代表彩虹的饱和度， ``val`` 代表彩虹的明度。 ``speed`` 则是每秒钟彩虹"
"完整循环的次数。如果 ``speed`` 是正数，动画会正向播放；如果设为 ``0`` ，动画"
"就会暂停；如果 ``speed`` 是负数，动画则会倒着播放。"

msgid ""
"Font outlines are *not* affected by the rainbow effect (they keep their "
"original color). Existing font colors are overridden by the rainbow effect. "
"However, CanvasItem's **Modulate** and **Self Modulate** properties will "
"affect how the rainbow effect looks, as modulation multiplies its final "
"colors."
msgstr ""
"字体描边（Font outlines） *不会* 受到彩虹特效的影响（它们会保持原本的颜色）。"
"而现有的字体颜色则会被彩虹特效直接覆盖。不过，CanvasItem 的 **Modulate** （调"
"制）和 **Self Modulate** （自调制）属性依然会影响彩虹特效的最终视觉效果，因为"
"调制操作会将这些属性与特效的最终颜色进行相乘混合。"

msgid "Custom BBCode tags and text effects"
msgstr "自定义 BBCode 标签和文本效果"

msgid ""
"You can extend the :ref:`class_RichTextEffect` resource type to create your "
"own custom BBCode tags. Create a new script file that extends "
"the :ref:`class_RichTextEffect` resource type and give the script a "
"``class_name`` so that the effect can be selected in the inspector. Add the "
"``@tool`` annotation to your GDScript file if you wish to have these custom "
"effects run within the editor itself. The RichTextLabel does not need to "
"have a script attached, nor does it need to be running in ``tool`` mode. The "
"new effect can be registered in the Inspector by adding it to the **Markup > "
"Custom Effects** array, or in code with the :ref:`install_effect() "
"<class_RichTextLabel_method_install_effect>` method:"
msgstr ""
"可以通过扩展 :ref:`class_RichTextEffect` 资源类型来创建自己的 BBCode 标签。首"
"先扩展 :ref:`class_RichTextEffect` 资源类型并为脚本提供 ``class_name``\\ ，这"
"样就能够在检查器中选择该效果。如果想在编辑器中运行这些自定义效果，请在 "
"GDScript 文件中添加 ``@tool`` 注解。RichTextLabel 不需要附加脚本，也不需要在 "
"``tool`` 模式下运行。注册效果的方法是将这个新建的效果在检查器中加入到 "
"**Markup > Custom Effects** 数组中，或者在代码中使用 :ref:`install_effect() "
"<class_RichTextLabel_method_install_effect>` 方法："

msgid ""
"Selecting a custom RichTextEffect after saving a script that extends "
"RichTextEffect with a ``class_name``"
msgstr ""
"在保存了一个带有 ``class_name`` 且继承自 RichTextEffect 的脚本之后，去选择一"
"个自定义的 RichTextEffect"

msgid ""
"If the custom effect is not registered within the RichTextLabel's **Markup > "
"Custom Effects** property, no effect will be visible and the original tag "
"will be left as-is."
msgstr ""
"“如果自定义特效没有在 RichTextLabel 的 **Markup > Custom Effects** 属性中进行"
"注册，那么该特效将不会显示，并且原始的标签会保持原样（直接作为普通文本显示出"
"来）。"

msgid ""
"There is only one function that you need to extend: "
"``_process_custom_fx(char_fx)``. Optionally, you can also provide a custom "
"BBCode identifier by adding a member name ``bbcode``. The code will check "
"the ``bbcode`` property automatically or will use the name of the file to "
"determine what the BBCode tag should be."
msgstr ""
"你只需要重写（extend）一个函数： ``_process_custom_fx(char_fx)`` 。另外，你还"
"可以选择性地添加一个名为 ``bbcode`` 的成员变量，来提供一个自定义的 BBCode 标"
"识符。代码会自动检查 ``bbcode`` 这个属性；如果你没设置它，程序就会直接使用该"
"脚本的文件名，来自动确定对应的 BBCode 标签是什么。"

msgid "``_process_custom_fx``"
msgstr "``_process_custom_fx``"

msgid ""
"This is where the logic of each effect takes place and is called once per "
"glyph during the draw phase of text rendering. This passes in "
"a :ref:`class_CharFXTransform` object, which holds a few variables to "
"control how the associated glyph is rendered:"
msgstr ""
"这里就是每个特效具体逻辑发挥作用的地方。在文字渲染的绘制阶段，它会为每一个字"
"形（glyph）被调用一次。它会传入一个 :ref:`class_CharFXTransform` 对象，这个对"
"象包含了一些变量，用来控制相关联的字形具体该如何被渲染："

msgid "``outline`` is ``true`` if effect is called for drawing text outline."
msgstr ""
"如果当前特效是在绘制文字描边时被调用的，那么 ``outline`` 的值就为 ``true`` 。"

msgid ""
"``range`` tells you how far into a given custom effect block you are in as "
"an index."
msgstr ""
"``range`` 会以索引（index）的形式，告诉你当前正处于某个自定义特效块中的第几个"
"位置。"

msgid ""
"``elapsed_time`` is the total amount of time the text effect has been "
"running."
msgstr "``elapsed_time`` 是文本效果运行的总时间."

msgid ""
"``visible`` will tell you whether the glyph is visible or not and will also "
"allow you to hide a given portion of text."
msgstr "``visible`` 会告诉你当前字形是否可见，同时也允许你隐藏指定的文本部分。"

msgid ""
"``offset`` is an offset position relative to where the given glyph should "
"render under normal circumstances."
msgstr "``offset`` 是相对于该字形在正常情况下本应渲染的位置，所产生的偏移量。"

msgid "``color`` is the color of a given glyph."
msgstr "``color`` 是指定字形（glyph）的颜色。"

msgid ""
"``glyph_index`` and ``font`` is glyph being drawn and font data resource "
"used to draw it."
msgstr ""
"``glyph_index`` 和 ``font`` 分别代表正在被绘制的字符（字形）索引，以及用来绘"
"制它的字体数据资源。"

msgid ""
"Finally, ``env`` is a :ref:`class_Dictionary` of parameters assigned to a "
"given custom effect. You can use :ref:`get() <class_Dictionary_method_get>` "
"with an optional default value to retrieve each parameter, if specified by "
"the user. For example ``[custom_fx spread=0.5 color=#FFFF00]test[/"
"custom_fx]`` would have a float ``spread`` and Color ``color`` parameters in "
"its ``env`` Dictionary. See below for more usage examples."
msgstr ""
"最后， ``env`` 是一个 :ref:`class_Dictionary` （字典），里面存放着分配给某个"
"自定义特效的参数。你可以使用 :ref:`get() <class_Dictionary_method_get>` 方法"
"（并带上一个可选的默认值）来提取每一个参数——前提是用户确实指定了它。举个例"
"子，如果你写了 ``[custom_fx spread=0.5 color=#FFFF00]test[/custom_fx]`` ，那"
"么它的 ``env`` 字典里就会包含一个浮点型的 ``spread`` 参数和一个 Color 类型的 "
"``color`` 参数。具体的更多使用示例，可以接着往下看哦。"

msgid ""
"The last thing to note about this function is that it is necessary to return "
"a boolean ``true`` value to verify that the effect processed correctly. This "
"way, if there's a problem with rendering a given glyph, it will back out of "
"rendering custom effects entirely until the user fixes whatever error "
"cropped up in their custom effect logic."
msgstr ""
"关于这个函数，最后一点需要注意的就是需要返回布尔值 ``true`` 来确认效果已正确"
"处理完毕。这样一来，如果在渲染某个字形时遇到了问题，就会跳出自定义效果的渲"
"染，直到用户修正了自定义效果逻辑中所发生的错误。"

msgid "Here are some examples of custom effects:"
msgstr "以下是一些自定义效果的示例:"

msgid "Ghost"
msgstr "幽灵"

msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "矩阵"

msgid "This will add a few new BBCode commands, which can be used like so:"
msgstr "这将增加一些新的BBCode命令, 可以像这样使用:"
